<title>PHILIPPINES: PCIBank plans one-for-10 rights offer.</title>
<headline>PCIBank plans one-for-10 rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Commercial International Bank (PCIBank) said on Monday it will undertake a one-for-10 rights offer that would raise about 5.0 billion pesos to boost its capital.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the bank said it will sell one share for every 10 shares held by existing shareholders at 305 pesos.</p>
